OL,5,G2100 Taggart
OL,6,     FWhen a mangled body is found in
OL,7,     Fthe machinery at a shipyard, the
OL,8,     Funion leader is quick to blame
OL,9,     Funsafe working practices - but the
OL,10,     Fteam soon discover the victim was
OL,11,     Falready dead...
OL,12,G2205 Taggart
OL,13,     FNurse Sandra White has been
OL,14,     Fstabbed to death and cab driver
OL,15,     FJim Campbell is the prime suspect
OL,16,     Fin her murder, but could there be
OL,17,     Fsomeone else who wanted her dead?
OL,18,G2310 Prisoner: Cell Block H
OL,19,     FThe women are down on Doreen for
OL,20,     Fhaving censorship brought back.
OL,21,     FBea calls a strike after David's
OL,22,     Fteaching hours are cut back.
